      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PETALI (6) had been racing well prior to his last start fourth at this track following a Grade 6 win three back with a second placing. Better than latest and can atone here. LAKEVIEW ROWDY (2) turned in a plain effort last time when fifth at this track over 525m behind Dewana Lynette (30.69) in a Grade 5. Was a winner prior to that. Has ability and is one of the better chances. HIGH FIVE INDI (1) is boxed nicely on the inside. Last start finished 6th on October 3 over 525m at this track behind Time Perpetuated beaten 5 lengths (30.64) in a Grade 5. Looks suited here and can measure up. DR. FANATICAL (7) is another with top-three prospects.",
